{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"16":{"eng-name":"The Chapters on Pawning","ara-name":"كتاب الرهون"}},"section_detail":{"16":{"hadithnumber_first":2436,"hadithnumber_last":2491,"arabicnumber_first":2436,"arabicnumber_last":2491}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2454,"arabicnumber":2454,"text":"Rapporté par Jabir bin 'Abdullah : Le Messager d’Allah (ﷺ) nous a adressé la parole et a dit : “Celui qui possède un terrain, qu’il le cultive ou qu’il permette à quelqu’un d’autre de le cultiver, mais qu’il ne le loue pas.”","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":16,"hadith":19},"chapter":{"id":8,"ara-name":"باب كِرَاءِ الأَرْضِ","eng-name":"Leasing Out Land","isFirstHadith":false}}]}